    "contentHTML": "<div class=\"learn-intro\">Applying citizenship knowledge practically — through debate, essay writing and heritage preservation tasks — helps consolidate learning and build real-world civic skills.</div><h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">1. Debate as a Civic Skill</h3><ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><li>Debating builds the ability to research, argue logically, and respond respectfully to opposing views.</li><li>A good debate speech states a clear position, supports it with evidence, and anticipates counterarguments.</li><li>Debate is widely used in civic and political life — from classroom discussions to parliamentary proceedings.</li></ul><h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">2. Essay Writing on Citizenship Topics</h3><div class=\"learn-table-wrap\"><table class=\"learn-table\"><thead><tr><th>Essay stage</th><th>What it involves</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Planning</td><td>Understanding the question, brainstorming points, creating an outline</td></tr><tr><td>Introduction</td><td>Clearly stating the topic and the writer's main argument or thesis</td></tr><tr><td>Body paragraphs</td><td>Each paragraph developing one main point with explanation and examples</td></tr><tr><td>Conclusion</td><td>Summarising the argument and restating its significance</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">3. Heritage Preservation Tasks</h3><ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><li>Interviewing elders to document oral history or traditional knowledge.</li><li>Creating a short profile of a local heritage site or practice.</li><li>Proposing practical steps a community could take to protect a heritage asset.</li><li>Presenting findings through a report, poster or oral presentation.</li></ul><h3 class=\"learn-subheading\">4. Skills Developed Through These Projects</h3><ul style=\"margin-left:20px;\"><li>Research and critical thinking.</li><li>Written and oral communication.</li><li>Collaboration and project planning.</li><li>Civic awareness through direct engagement with real community issues.</li></ul><div class=\"learn-tip-box\"><span class=\"learn-tip-icon\">💡</span> <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> Even though this is a practical topic, you can still be examined on the STEPS and SKILLS involved in debate, essay writing, and heritage documentation.</div>",
